# GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2: React Router RSC Mode CSRF Bypass
# Affected: react-router >= 7.12.0 < 8.3.0
# This project does not use React Server Components (RSC) or any unstable RSC APIs.
# The vulnerability is only exploitable via the unstable RSC code paths.
# Upgrading to the patched version (react-router@8.x) would require React 19,
# which is a breaking change this project has not adopted.
GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2
